{"verse_key": "72:3", "surah": 72, "verse": 3, "text_uthmani": "وَأَنَّهُۥ تَعَـٰلَىٰ جَدُّ رَبِّنَا مَا ٱتَّخَذَ صَـٰحِبَةً وَلَا وَلَدًا", "translation": "And [it teaches] that exalted is the nobleness of our Lord; He has not taken a wife or a son", "verse_from_ms": 27300, "verse_to_ms": 36440, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/72.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَأَنَّهُۥ", "start_ms": 27300, "end_ms": 29210}, {"i": 1, "text": "تَعَـٰلَىٰ", "start_ms": 29210, "end_ms": 30220}, {"i": 2, "text": "جَدُّ", "start_ms": 30220, "end_ms": 30820}, {"i": 3, "text": "رَبِّنَا", "start_ms": 30820, "end_ms": 31810}, {"i": 4, "text": "مَا", "start_ms": 31810, "end_ms": 31980}, {"i": 5, "text": "ٱتَّخَذَ", "start_ms": 31980, "end_ms": 32760}, {"i": 6, "text": "صَـٰحِبَةً", "start_ms": 32760, "end_ms": 34390}, {"i": 7, "text": "وَلَا", "start_ms": 34390, "end_ms": 34920}, {"i": 8, "text": "وَلَدًا", "start_ms": 34920, "end_ms": 36365}]}